                <pb facs="0264" n="180" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg180"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Loomis to Mr.
                            Beaupré.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-08-13"><hi rendition="#italic">August 13,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Have you received Department cable of July 31? Amendments suggested in your cable
                    of the 5th would be fatal to treaty.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Loomis.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
